      "name": "A Wager of Moonlight",
      "source": "Nefer · Passive",
      "category": "passive",
      "description": "At 3 or more Veils of Falsehood, the active 8-second buff grants 100 Elemental Mastery. Each current Veil also increases Phantasm Performance DMG by 8%; C2 raises the Veil limit to 5.",
